@baseUrl = http://localhost:5260
@runId = replace-with-run-id

### Read durable command history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/journal?afterSequence=0&limit=100

### Verify semantic replay
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/verify

### Page durable event projections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/events?afterSequence=0&limit=100

### Subscribe with a resumable SSE cursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/events/stream?afterSequence=0
Accept: text/event-stream
